  "<color=#EADE10>[Signature can obtain 5★ Thief, 4★ Thief, and few low Rank 2★ Persona]</color>\\n[The following obtained Thief or Persona are collectively called Character]": "",
  "<color=#EADE10>[Kaidol Draft X]</color> is a permanent Contract, and is a <color=#EADE10>[Standard Contract]</color>, players can use <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color> to Sign a Contract. The pity is independent and is not shared with other types of Contracts.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>Obtain at least 1 4★ Character every <color=#EADE10>$2</color> Signature.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>Obtain 1 5★ Character every <color=#EADE10>$3</color> Signature.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>Will always obtain [$4] from the Signature tutorial, and will not count in the Signature total.": "",
  "In this Contract <color=#EADE10>[Kaidol Draft X]</color>, the probability to obtain 5★ and 4★ are as follows:\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The base probability of 5★ Character is <color=#EADE10>$1</color>; consolidated probability (incl. guarantee) is <color=#EADE10>$2</color>；\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The base probability of 4★ Character is <color=#EADE10>$3</color>; consolidated probability is <color=#EADE10>$4</color>；": "",
  "By any means (Signature, shop redeem, system redeem, etc)\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$1nd~$2th</color> time you obtain the same 5★ Thief, it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$3</color> <color=#EADE10>that character's [Thief Awareness]</color> and <color=#EADE10>$4</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>; From the <color=#EADE10>$5th</color> time onwards it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$6</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>. \\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$7nd~$8th</color> time you obtain the same 4★ Thief, it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$9</color> <color=#EADE10>that character's [Thief Awareness]</color> and <color=#EADE10>$10</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>; From the <color=#EADE10>$11th</color> time onwards it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$12</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$13st</color> time you obtain a 2★ Persona, it will be converted into that Persona's <color=#EADE10>[Seal]</color>.\\n\\nOnly when obtaining 2★ Persona through Signature\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When you obtain 2★ Persona, obtain <color=#EADE10>$17</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognitive Shard]</color>.\\n\\nWhen you reach <color=#EADE10>$18</color> Signature in <color=#EADE10>[Kaidol Draft X]</color>, choose <color=#EADE10>1</color> 5★ Character. (Choose 1 every $19, only $20 time)\\n$21": "",
  "By any means (Signature, shop redeem, system redeem, etc)\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$1nd~$2th</color> time you obtain the same 5★ Thief, it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$3</color> <color=#EADE10>that character's [Thief Awareness]</color> and <color=#EADE10>$4</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>; \\nFrom the <color=#EADE10>$5th</color> time onwards it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$6</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>; \\nLimited 5★ Thief will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$7</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognitive Essence]</color>, \\nStandard 5★ Thief will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$8</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognitive Essence]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$9nd~$10th</color> time you obtain the same 4★ Thief, it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$11</color> <color=#EADE10>that character's [Thief Awareness]</color> and <color=#EADE10>$12</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>; From the <color=#EADE10>$13th</color> time onwards it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$14</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$15st</color> time you obtain a 2★ Persona, it will be converted into that Persona's <color=#EADE10>[Seal]</color>.\\n\\nOnly when obtaining 2★ Persona through Signature\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When you obtain 2★ Persona, obtain <color=#EADE10>$19</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognitive Shard]</color>.\\n\\nWhen you reach <color=#EADE10>$20</color> Signature in <color=#EADE10>[Kaidol Draft X]</color>, choose <color=#EADE10>$21</color> 5★ Character. (Choose 1 every $22, only $23 time)\\n$24": "",
  "[When RATE UP or guaranteed rule is not triggered, all Characters share the same base obtain probability]\\n<sprite=0 tint=1><color=#EADE10>5★ Characters</color>\\nBase probability: $1 (incl. guarantee: $2)\\n$3\\n\\n<sprite=0 tint=1><color=#EADE10>4★ Characters</color>\\nBase probability: $4 (incl. guarantee: $5)\\n$6\\n\\n<sprite=0 tint=1><color=#EADE10>2★ Characters</color>\\nBase probability: $7\\n$8": "",
  "Event Contract <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color> is now available.\\nThe Contract 5★ Character is a <color=#EADE10>[Limited Character]</color>, they will not be available in the Standard Contract <color=#EADE10>[Kaidol Draft X]</color> after the event ends.\\n<color=#EADE10>[Signature can obtain 5★ Thief, 4★ Thief, and few low Rank 2★ Persona]</color>\\n[The following obtained Thief or Persona are collectively called Character]": "",
  "Event Contract <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color> is now available.\\nThe Contract 5★ Character is a <color=#EADE10>[Standard Character]</color>, they will be available in the Standard Contract <color=#EADE10>[Kaidol Draft X]</color> after the event ends.\\n<color=#EADE10>[Signature can obtain 5★ Thief, 4★ Thief, and few low Rank 2★ Persona]</color>\\n[The following obtained Thief or Persona are collectively called Character]": "",
  "<sprite=0 tint=1>During this event, players can use <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color> to Sign a Contract. Heavily increase the chance to obtain the RATE UP 5★ Character <color=#EADE10>[$2]</color> and 4★ Characters <color=#EADE10>[$3]</color>, <color=#EADE10>[$4]</color>, <color=#EADE10>[$5]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>During this event, obtain at least 1 4★ every <color=#EADE10>$6</color> Signature.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>During this event, guarantee obtain the current RATE UP 5★ Character every <color=#EADE10>$7</color> Signature.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>This Contract is <color=#EADE10>[$8]</color>, share the Signature count between the same Contract system, will not reset after this event ends. Carry the 5★ Character obtain chance with Signature count increase to future <color=#EADE10>[$9]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>For every <color=#EADE10>$10</color> Signature in [100% Contract], additionally obtain 1 current [5★ Random Kaidol Contract]. [5★ Random Kaidol Contract] content will change with the version, and the content will be based on the version when you obtained it. If you can obtain [5★ Random Kaidol Contract] but did not claim it, it will be automatically claimed after the event ends and will be sent via mail. Share this number with future event Contract of the same type, the number less than $11 can be carried to future event Contract of the same type.": "",
  "In this event Contract <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color>, the probability to obtain 5★ and 4★ are as follows:\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The base probability of 5★ Character is <color=#EADE10>$2</color>; consolidated probability (incl. guarantee) is <color=#EADE10>$3</color>；\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The base probability of 4★ Character is <color=#EADE10>$4</color>; consolidated probability is <color=#EADE10>$5</color>；\\n\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When obtaining a 5★ Character, there is a <color=#EADE10>$6</color> chance to obtain the current RATE UP 5★ Character <color=#EADE10>[$7]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When obtaining a 4★ Character, there is a <color=#EADE10>$8</color> chance to obtain one of the following RATE UP 4★ Characters <color=#EADE10>[$9]</color>, <color=#EADE10>[$10]</color>, <color=#EADE10>[$11]</color>, they all have equal chance. If the obtained 4★ Character is not the RATE UP Character, then the next obtained 4★ is guaranteed to be the RATE UP Character.": "",
  "<sprite=0 tint=1>During this event, players can use <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color> to Sign a Contract. Heavily increase the chance to obtain the RATE UP 5★ Character <color=#EADE10>[$2]</color> and 4★ Characters <color=#EADE10>[$3]</color>, <color=#EADE10>[$4]</color>, <color=#EADE10>[$5]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>During this event, obtain at least 1 4★ every <color=#EADE10>$6</color> Signature.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>During this event, obtain 1 5★ Character every <color=#EADE10>$7</color> Signature.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>This Contract is <color=#EADE10>[$8]</color>, share the Signature count between the same Contract system, will not reset after this event ends. Carry the 5★ Character obtain chance with Signature count increase to future <color=#EADE10>[$9]</color>.": "",
  "In this event Contract <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color>, the probability to obtain 5★ and 4★ are as follows:\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The base probability of 5★ Character is <color=#EADE10>$2</color>; consolidated probability (incl. guarantee) is <color=#EADE10>$3</color>；\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The base probability of 4★ Character is <color=#EADE10>$4</color>; consolidated probability is <color=#EADE10>$5</color>；\\n\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When obtaining a 5★ Character, there is a <color=#EADE10>$6</color> chance to obtain the current RATE UP 5★ Character <color=#EADE10>[$7]</color>. If the obtained 5★ Character is not the RATE UP Character, then the next obtained 5★ is guaranteed to be the RATE UP Character.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When obtaining a 4★ Character, there is a <color=#EADE10>$8</color> chance to obtain one of the following RATE UP 4★ Characters <color=#EADE10>[$9]</color>, <color=#EADE10>[$10]</color>, <color=#EADE10>[$11]</color>, they all have equal chance. If the obtained 4★ Character is not the RATE UP Character, then the next obtained 4★ is guaranteed to be the RATE UP Character.": "",
  "By any means (Signature, shop redeem, system redeem, etc)\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$1nd~$2th</color> time you obtain the same 5★ Thief, it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$3</color> <color=#EADE10>that character's [Thief Awareness]</color> and <color=#EADE10>$4</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>; From the <color=#EADE10>$5th</color> time onwards it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$6</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>. \\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$7nd~$8th</color> time you obtain the same 4★ Thief, it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$9</color> <color=#EADE10>that character's [Thief Awareness]</color> and <color=#EADE10>$10</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>; From the <color=#EADE10>$11th</color> time onwards it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$12</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$13st</color> time you obtain a 2★ Persona, it will be converted into that Persona's <color=#EADE10>[Seal]</color>.\\n\\nOnly when obtaining 2★ Persona through Signature\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When you obtain 2★ Persona, obtain <color=#EADE10>$17</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognitive Shard]</color>.": "",
  "By any means (Signature, shop redeem, system redeem, etc)\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$1nd~$2th</color> time you obtain the same 5★ Thief, it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$3</color> <color=#EADE10>that character's [Thief Awareness]</color> and <color=#EADE10>$4</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>; \\nFrom the <color=#EADE10>$5th</color> time onwards it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$6</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>; \\nLimited 5★ Thief will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$7</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognitive Essence]</color>, \\nStandard 5★ Thief will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$8</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognitive Essence]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$9nd~$10th</color> time you obtain the same 4★ Thief, it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$11</color> <color=#EADE10>that character's [Thief Awareness]</color> and <color=#EADE10>$12</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>; From the <color=#EADE10>$13th</color> time onwards it will be converted into <color=#EADE10>$14</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Gemstone]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The <color=#EADE10>$15st</color> time you obtain a 2★ Persona, it will be converted into that Persona's <color=#EADE10>[Seal]</color>.\\n\\nOnly when obtaining 2★ Persona through Signature\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When you obtain 2★ Persona, obtain <color=#EADE10>$19</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognitive Shard]</color>.": "",
  "Custom Contract <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color> is now available.\\n<color=#EADE10>[Signature can obtain 5★ Thief, 4★ Thief, and few low Rank 2★ Persona]</color>\\n[The following obtained Thief or Persona are collectively called Character]": "",
  "In this event Contract <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color>, the probability to obtain 5★ and 4★ are as follows:\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The base probability of 5★ Character is <color=#EADE10>$2</color>; consolidated probability (incl. guarantee) is <color=#EADE10>$3</color>；\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The base probability of 4★ Character is <color=#EADE10>$4</color>; consolidated probability is <color=#EADE10>$5</color>；\\n\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When obtaining a 5★ Character, there is a <color=#EADE10>$6</color> chance to obtain the current Custom RATE UP 5★ Character <color=#EADE10>[$7]</color>.": "",
