  "Event Supply <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color> is now available.\\nThe 5★ Weapon <color=#EADE10>[$2]</color> is a <color=#EADE10>[Limited Weapon]</color>, it will not be available in <color=#EADE10>[Customize Weapon]</color>.": "",
  "<sprite=0 tint=1>During this event, players can use [$1] to Supply Weapon. Heavily increase the chance to obtain the Custom RATE UP 5★ Weapon <color=#EADE10>[$2]</color> and 4★ Weapons <color=#EADE10>[$3], [$4], [$5], [$6]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>Players can change the RATE UP Weapon at any time.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>Players need to choose 2 5★ Weapons before Supply.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>During this event, obtain at least 1 4★ Weapon every <color=#EADE10>$7</color> Supply.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>During this event, obtain 1 5★ Weapon every <color=#EADE10>$8</color> Supply.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>This Supply is <color=#EADE10>[Weapon Supply]</color>, share the Supply count between the same Supply system, will not reset after this event ends. Carry the 5★ Weapon obtain chance with Supply count increase to future <color=#EADE10>[Weapon Supply]</color>.": "",
  "In this event <color=#EADE10>[$1]</color>, the probability to obtain 5★ and 4★ are as follows:\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The base probability of 5★ Weapon is <color=#EADE10>$2</color>; consolidated probability (incl. guarantee) is <color=#EADE10>$3</color>；\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>The base probability of 4★ Weapon is <color=#EADE10>$4</color>; consolidated probability is <color=#EADE10>$5</color>；\\n\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When obtaining a 5★ Weapon, there is a <color=#EADE10>$6</color> chance to obtain the Custom RATE UP 5★ Weapon <color=#EADE10>[$7]</color>. If the obtained 5★ Weapon is not the 5★ RATE UP Weapon, you will only obtain one of the 2 Custom 5★ Weapons, then the next obtained 5★ Weapon is guaranteed to be the 5★ RATE UP Weapon.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When obtaining a 4★ Weapon, there is a <color=#EADE10>$8</color> chance to obtain one of the following RATE UP 4★ Weapons <color=#EADE10>[$9], [$10], [$11], [$12]</color>, they all have equal chance. If the obtained 4★ Weapon is not a RATE UP Weapon, then the next obtained 4★ Weapon is guaranteed to be the RATE UP Weapon.": "",
  "Through Supply\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When you obtain 5★ Weapon, obtain <color=#EADE10>$1</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognitive Gemstone]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When you obtain a 4★ Weapon, obtain <color=#EADE10>$2</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognitive Gemstone]</color>.\\n<sprite=0 tint=1>When you obtain 3★ Weapon, obtain <color=#EADE10>$3</color> <color=#EADE10>[Cognition Shard]</color>.": "",
  "[When RATE UP or guaranteed rule is not triggered, all Weapons share the same base obtain probability]\\n<sprite=0 tint=1><color=#EADE10>5★ Weapons</color>\\nBase probability: $1 (incl. guarantee: $2)\\nCurrent Custom RATE UP Weapon: [$3]\\n\\n<sprite=0 tint=1><color=#EADE10>4★ Weapons</color>\\nBase probability: $4 (incl. guarantee: $5)\\n$6\\n\\n<sprite=0 tint=1><color=#EADE10>3★ Weapons</color>\\nBase probability: $7\\n$8": "",
  "[When RATE UP or guaranteed rule is not triggered, all Weapons share the same base obtain probability]\\n<sprite=0 tint=1><color=#EADE10>5★ Weapons</color>\\nBase probability: $1 (incl. guarantee: $2)\\nCurrent Custom RATE UP Weapon: [$3]\\nCurrent Custom non RATE UP: [$4], [$5]\\n\\n<sprite=0 tint=1><color=#EADE10>4★ Weapons</color>\\nBase probability: $6 (incl. guarantee: $7)\\n$8\\n\\n<sprite=0 tint=1><color=#EADE10>3★ Weapons</color>\\nBase probability: $9\\n$10": "",
